This is an independent implementation. It is not affiliated with TypeSafe AI, Qwen /
Alibaba, Google, or the JevBench maintainers, and it contains neither Jev's proprietary
weights nor its training recipe. Qwen3.5 weights must be obtained separately under their
upstream license (Apache-2.0).

The Qwen3.5 decoder follows the public Hugging Face transformers reference
(models/qwen3_5/modeling_qwen3_5.py) and the design of MaxText's Qwen3.5 / Gated DeltaNet
code; parity with transformers is tested (tests/model/test_parity.py). JevBench public
items are used only for final measurement and are not redistributed. No pretrained weights
or third-party dataset records are redistributed; the license of every data source is
recorded in the source registry (src/tjev/data/sources/) and in each built mix's
manifest.json.

